5. Fingerprint instances **exist** on local DEMO (7 PENDING + 3 APPROVED PR) — no in-place hash change.  
6. Local `ERPWeb` / SQLEXPRESS is a **shared DEMO tenant with policy ON** — forbidden as Gate 3 test DB.
